# Digital Audio: A Sound Design Element.

**Authors:** Barron, Ann, Varnadoe, Susan

## Abstract
Discussion of incorporating audio into videodiscs for multimedia educational applications highlights a project developed for the Navy that used digital audio in an interactive video delivery system (IVDS) for training sonar operators. Storage constraints with videodiscs are explained, design requirements for the IVDS are described, and production procedures are discussed. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ446202

